who use Cloud Code or Codex.

251
00:11:04,400 --> 00:11:06,400
Now, the idea is simple.

252
00:11:06,400 --> 00:11:09,440
We are going to take all the tasks you do in your day-to-day

253
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:11,280
in your week-to-week, whether it's in your personal life

254
00:11:11,280 --> 00:11:13,600
or your business and turn them into skills.

255
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:16,800
And if it makes sense, turn those skills into automations.

